title: 更换领导层
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer = 0 and difficulty >= 0
on-arrival: month_activities += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 8;
card-image: img/vorwarts_2.jpg
go-to: rm_main

更换党内领导层是痛苦的,但为了适应时局的变化,或许有此必要。

撤换顾问会加剧其所属派系的异议;而增补顾问则会增强该派系的实力,并减少其异议。

- @rm_main: 撤换顾问
- @add_advisors: 添加顾问
- @remove_none: 不更换顾问。
- @easy_discard


###################### removing leaders

@rm_main
title: 撤换顾问。
tags: center_advisor, left_advisor, reformist_advisor, labor_advisor, neorev_advisor, nonfactional_advisor 
frequency: 1

- #remove_advisor
- @add_advisors: 添加顾问

@remove_none
title: 停止更换顾问。
go-to: root
tags: remove_advisor


